<title>USA: Fed says Wednesday's 8-day repo totaled $6.579 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says Wednesday's 8-day repo totaled $6.579 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $6.579 bilion during its eight-day fixed system repurchase agreement operation on Wednesday, a New York Fed spokesperson said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
